For a Dual-63c09e RP2350b

0:7     D* (E High)

20:22   BS,AVMA,LIC (E High)   OPTIONAL

25      LED
26:28   (Serial,Shift,Latch) for (RESET,HALT,NMI,IRQ,FIRQ)
29:30   E0, Q0 (out, also negated for CPU1)
31      R/W (E Low)
32:47   A* (E Low)



